The Console shows JavaScript errors with what went wrong and where (file:line:column). A misspelled function is "not a function". An id in JavaScript that doesn't match the HTML makes getElementById return null, which leads to "Cannot set properties of null". Workflow: change → save → refresh → check the Console.

